msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [Introduction to options](/guides/runtime-options-overview) guide.\n"
"- Find more details about the `SamplerV2` methods in the [Sampler API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2).\n"
"- Decide what [execution mode](execution-modes) to run your job in.\n"
"- Learn about [noise management with Sampler](/guides/sampler-noise-management).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"توصيات\">\n"
"- راجع دليل [مقدمة الخيارات](/guides/runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- اعثر على مزيد من التفاصيل حول أساليب `SamplerV2` في [مرجع Sampler API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2).\n"
"- قرر [وضع التنفيذ](execution-modes) الذي ستشغل مهمتك فيه.\n"
"- تعرف على [إدارة الضوضاء مع Sampler](/guides/sampler-noise-management).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
